+### Switch M02 virtual-CDVD metadata bounds (2026-11-09)
+
+The CPU-foundation audit found a uint32 directory-size wrap in the generic IOP
+virtual-ISO builder, reproduced with synthetic identifier sizes and its actual
+writer. The maintained root patch rejects unrepresentable extents and capacity
+violations. This does not establish a game-specific failure, new guest address,
+or Switch occurrence. Valid metadata is compared against the pinned writer.
+The synthetic virtual-ISO builder is still not the port's required manifest/LBA
+folder-disc adapter; the root M03 filesystem acceptance remains separate.
